{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039770/extras/57df06a969bfd2f3997e9b02135ef3f8.avif?t=1759394201\" width=900 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Glistening Moments, Timeless Memories'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a midnight soir\u00e9e shaped by the night\u2019s cool hush and the texture of light.<br>Collect moments that glimmer like reflections on crystal, and let them sharpen with every replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Lucent Soir\u00e9e\u2019 is a new DLC for EZ2ON REBOOT : R.<br>Enjoy music meticulously crafted by a roster of composers, created especially for this release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039770/extras/6e29b88db1ddc63faad5173ce9dff101.avif?t=1759394201\" width=900 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u22c6 tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>In My Eyes</strong> | by KARUT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>DALTOKKI</strong> | by ATAS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>What gives</strong> | by Sobrem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>SPEEDMAX RAVE</strong> | by NAOKI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Lost Memory</strong> | by Scarfaith</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Devote</strong> | by \u307a\u306e\u308c\u308a (penoreri)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Galaxy Breaker</strong> | by \u9ed2\u6ca2\u30c0\u30a4\u30b9\u30b1 (Daisuke Kurosawa)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Evolution Revolver</strong> | by BlackY vs. Yooh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Ready Acid, Ready Techno</strong> | by Hommarju</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Hidden (\u79d8\u4f1d)</strong> | by A1NVERSE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Acnoss</strong> | by onoken</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>WUVXZY</strong> | by Ice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Fragments of U</strong> | by Reku Mochizuki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>Rave All Night</strong> | by Massive New Krew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 <strong>\u661f\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066 (feat. Sennzai)</strong> | by ARForest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 Includes a dedicated panel skin, note skin, combo skin, and judgment skin set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u22c6 This DLC does not include a theme skin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u22c6 On December 19, 10 new songs will be added through the <strong>Chapter 2 update</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039770?t=1759394201","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039770/64beb46400aed5187053c0fe56d81de6a5ed8a08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759394201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039770/921d1f28f83699bb7e1b63a9307416e877340215/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759394201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039770/921d1f28f83699bb7e1b63a9307416e877340215/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759394201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id